    <string name="perm_status_checking">Checking permissions…</string>
    <string name="perm_status_granted">Precise location granted. Sensors ready.</string>
    <string name="perm_status_needed">Driftless needs precise location to anchor the
        dead-reckoning track to a starting fix.</string>
    <string name="perm_status_rationale">Without precise location there is nothing to
        anchor the track to, and nothing to correct its drift against. The app cannot
        do anything useful until this is granted.</string>
    <string name="perm_status_permanently_denied">Location is permanently denied. Android
        will not show the prompt again — it has to be granted from app settings.</string>
    <string name="perm_status_coarse_only">Approximate location only. That is roughly
        1–3 km of error, which is far larger than the drift this app exists to
        measure. Grant PRECISE location to continue.</string>

    <string name="perm_status_services_off">Location permission is granted, but Location
        is switched off for the whole phone, so no fix will ever arrive. Turn it on in
        system settings.</string>

